msgid "Advanced"
msgstr "Rozšírené"

msgid "Wrapper ID"
msgstr "ID obalu"

msgid "Unique ID used for anchor links"
msgstr "Jedinečné ID pre odkazy na kotvy"

msgid "Wrapper classes"
msgstr "Triedy obalu"

msgid "Multiple classes separated by space. Use TailwindCSS <a href=\"@url\" target=\"_blank\">utility classes</a>."
msgstr "Viac tried oddeľte medzerou. Použite <a href=\"@url\" target=\"_blank\">utility triedy</a> TailwindCSS."

msgid "The visual part can be edited via the <a href=\"@url\">layout</a> tab"
msgstr "Vizuálnu časť upravíte na záložke <a href=\"@url\">rozloženie</a>"

msgid "This page has not been published yet, only privileged users can see it."
msgstr "Táto stránka zatiaľ nie je zverejnená, vidia ju len oprávnení používatelia."

msgid "This page has no translation for the current language, only privileged users can see it."
msgstr "Táto stránka nemá preklad do aktuálneho jazyka, vidia ju len oprávnení používatelia."

msgid "Scheduler publishes this content on @date."
msgstr "Naplánované zverejnenie: @date."

msgid "Scheduler unpublishes this content on @date."
msgstr "Naplánované skrytie: @date."

msgid "Drupal Kit: menu language filtering"
msgstr "Drupal Kit: filtrovanie menu podľa jazyka"

msgid "Available"
msgstr "Dostupné"

msgid "Not available"
msgstr "Nedostupné"

msgid "The <code>menu.language_tree_manipulator</code> service is missing, so menus built by Drupal Kit are not filtered by the current content language — links from every language will appear. The service ships with the Drupal core patch from <a href=\":url\">issue #2466553</a>."
msgstr "Služba <code>menu.language_tree_manipulator</code> chýba, takže menu zostavené modulom Drupal Kit sa nefiltrujú podľa aktuálneho jazyka obsahu — objavia sa odkazy zo všetkých jazykov. Službu prináša patch jadra Drupalu z <a href=\":url\">issue #2466553</a>."

